      "source": "Returns whether the map contains a named query for the given name. If this method returns true you can\nexpect <a href=\"../NamedQueries.html#getQuery(java.lang.String)\"><code>NamedQueries.getQuery(String)</code></a> to return a non-null query for the very same name.",
